  ("How much does AC repair cost in Hamilton?", "AC repair in Hamilton is quoted in writing after diagnosis, because the price depends on the failed part. A capacitor or contactor is a modest repair; a compressor or evaporator coil is not. If replacement is the better value, a cold-climate heat pump that cools like a central AC starts at $5,500 installed."),
  ("Why does my lower-city house feel damp even with the AC on?", "An air conditioner that is too big for the house cools the air quickly and shuts off before it has removed much moisture, which is why oversized units in humid lower-city neighbourhoods leave rooms feeling clammy. Longer run times, a lower fan speed or a correctly sized inverter unit fix it."),
